{"id":"599359","name":"酥脆薯塔","author":"灵的厨坊","authorId":"5892322","desc":"","cover":"images/599359/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"3个"}],"sub":[{"name":"玉米淀粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"清水冲洗干净。","img":"images/599359/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去皮。","img":"images/599359/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"土豆修成长方形，注意长方形的厚度不要太厚。","img":"images/599359/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取一双筷子放至土豆两侧。","img":"images/599359/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"横着切，不要切断！","img":"images/599359/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"接着翻一面，斜着切，不要切断。切好的薯塔用清洗冲洗两遍。(洗掉淀粉)","img":"images/599359/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中水烧开，放少许盐，放入薯塔，1分钟捞出。过凉水。","img":"images/599359/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"擦干水份。","img":"images/599359/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"撒上淀粉。","img":"images/599359/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"油烧热，一定要烧热，放薯塔，炸至酥脆。","img":"images/599359/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"可以炸两遍，这样整串的薯塔里外才会都酥脆。","img":"images/599359/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"少许椒盐，番茄酱，很美味。","img":"images/599359/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"😋","img":"images/599359/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"😋","img":"images/599359/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"用剩余的边角切长条，炸成薯条。","img":"images/599359/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"😋","img":"images/599359/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}